{"seq":2,"slug":"sync-engines","title":"同步引擎篇","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-offline-sync/sync-engines","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"sync-protocol-design","title":"同步协议设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-offline-sync/sync-engines/sync-protocol-design","wordCount":1971,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"conflict-resolution-strategies","title":"冲突解决策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-offline-sync/sync-engines/conflict-resolution-strategies","wordCount":1859,"readingTime":8},{"seq":3,"slug":"crdt-mobile-applications","title":"CRDT 在移动端的应用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-offline-sync/sync-engines/crdt-mobile-applications","wordCount":1754,"readingTime":8}],"introMarkdown":"# 同步引擎篇\n\n当本地数据库成为第一真相源后，核心挑战转向「如何让多设备、多用户的数据最终收敛到一致状态」。本章从协议设计出发，逐步深入冲突解决的策略空间，最后聚焦 CRDT 这一 2026 年移动端同步的主流数学工具。\n\n三篇文档构成递进关系：先设计同步协议的传输层与操作语义，再分析冲突发生时的各类解决策略，最后将 CRDT 理论映射到移动端的内存与带宽约束下。这三篇是后续平台实现章节的理论支撑。\n"}